   "title": {
    "zh": "谁和谁最亲近",
    "en": "Who Is Closest?"
   },
   "why": {
    "zh": "从群聊讲起：数共同群聊会得出“老板最亲近”；再到芯片，讲清直接连线、共同邻居和按群大小摊薄三种评分。",
    "en": "It starts with group chats, where counting them says the boss is your closest person, then moves to a chip: direct wires, shared neighbours, and sharing a net out by its size."
   },
