     "transcript": [
      {
       "start": 3.4,
       "end": 7.756,
       "text": "聚类的第一步：谁和谁更该在一起？",
       "sceneId": "k01-question"
      },
      {
       "start": 7.756,
       "end": 12.356,
       "text": "给每一对打一个分，再从高到低排好。",
       "sceneId": "k01-question"
      },
      {
       "start": 12.356,
       "end": 16.489,
       "text": "注意：分数只排名，不分组。",
       "sceneId": "k01-question"
      },
      {
       "start": 16.889,
       "end": 22.356,
       "text": "第一种：直接边权，线有多粗，分数就是多少。",
       "sceneId": "k02-edge"
      },
      {
       "start": 22.356,
       "end": 26.044,
       "text": "G01 的 6 条边，就是 6 对。",
       "sceneId": "k02-edge"
      },
      {
       "start": 26.044,
       "end": 33.289,
       "text": "A–B 和 D–E 并列 5：按 (−分数, u, v) 排，A–B 在前。",
       "sceneId": "k02-edge"
      },
      {
       "start": 33.689,
       "end": 36.489,
       "text": "第二种：共同邻居。",
       "sceneId": "k03-shared"
      },
      {
       "start": 36.489,
       "end": 39.289,
       "text": "A–C：直接边 1。",
       "sceneId": "k03-shared"
      },
      {
       "start": 39.289,
       "end": 45.867,
       "text": "再加经过 B 的联系：取较弱的边，min(5, 4) = 4。",
       "sceneId": "k03-shared"
      },
      {
       "start": 45.867,
       "end": 47.667,
       "text": "合计 5。",
       "sceneId": "k03-shared"
      },
      {
       "start": 48.067,
       "end": 50.867,
       "text": "B 和 D 之间没有线，",
       "sceneId": "k04-bd"
      },
      {
       "start": 50.867,
       "end": 55.444,
       "text": "但经过 C 得到 min(4, 2) = 2。",
       "sceneId": "k04-bd"
      },
      {
       "start": 55.444,
       "end": 61.133,
       "text": "所以要检查所有 10 对，没有线的对也可能有分。",
       "sceneId": "k04-bd"
      },
      {
       "start": 61.533,
       "end": 68.333,
       "text": "换评分，第一对会变。看原作者的 priority 图。",
       "sceneId": "k05-priority"
      },
      {
       "start": 68.333,
       "end": 72.244,
       "text": "直接边权：X–Y = 5 排第一。",
       "sceneId": "k05-priority"
      },
      {
       "start": 72.244,
       "end": 77.933,
       "text": "共同邻居：P–Q = 4 + 4 = 8，超过了 X–Y。",
       "sceneId": "k05-priority"
      },
      {
       "start": 78.333,
       "end": 86.022,
       "text": "第三种用于多引脚 net：两条 5 引脚的宽 net，一条私有 net。",
       "sceneId": "k06-pin"
      },
      {
       "start": 86.022,
       "end": 89.933,
       "text": "每个 net 摊成 |e| − 1 份。",
       "sceneId": "k06-pin"
      },
      {
       "start": 89.933,
       "end": 95.844,
       "text": "A–B 只得 1/4 + 1/4 = 0.5，E–F 得 1。",
       "sceneId": "k06-pin"
      },
      {
       "start": 96.244,
       "end": 98.378,
       "text": "记住四点。",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
      },
      {
       "start": 98.378,
       "end": 101.044,
       "text": "只排名，不分组；",
       "sceneId": "k07-take"
      },
      {
       "start": 101.044,
       "end": 103.644,
       "text": "排名要稳定；",
